      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T09:19:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi @siyuanh@google.com, @bhaktha@google.com, @wescande@google.com and @okamil@google.com, or how about:\n```c\nvoid disconnectAllBrEdrAcls() {\n        if (mAdapterProperties \u003d\u003d null) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        BluetoothDevice[] bondedDevices \u003d mAdapterProperties.getBondedDevices();\n        for (BluetoothDevice device : bondedDevices) {\n            if (isConnected(device)) {\n                mNativeInterface.disconnectAcl(device, TRANSPORT_BREDR);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n```",
